{
    "title": "Solitaire: Classic Card Games",
    "description": "\u200b\u200bClassic Solitaire is the best way to play the classic card games you know & love!\r\n\r\nThe most popular card game in the world, classic Solitaire, also known as Patience, is great to relax. Train your brain with solitaire classic games. With beautiful cards, fun animations, & free, offline play, basic Solitaire is the best card game to pass time. Expose all playing cards, and be the Solitaire Master! With both random & winnable Solitaire decks & beautiful graphics, Classic Solitaire is one of the most Solitaire games in the world.\r\n\r\nWant to test your patience with card games? Classic Solitaire is perfect! Designed for all ages, Solitaire is the perfect classic games for seniors. Choose from multiple modes and become the Solitaire King! The Classic Solitaire cards app is customizable - personalize the look & feel of your Classic Solitaire & classic games for seniors. Download Classic Solitaire now & start playing our solitaire classic!\r\n\r\nDo you have the perfect strategy for Classic Solitaire? Try daily challenges or play unlimited solitaire card games & winnable solitaire decks! Test your patience & choose between classic Solitaire or Vegas scoring, then become the Solitaire King! Try our daily Solitaire challenges & customize your solitaire classic games cards, table, & Solitaire games mode to play your way! These solitaire classic games will hook you on Classic Solitaire card games!\r\n\r\nClassic Solitaire Games Features:\r\n\u2663 Classic Solitaire card games for seniors\r\n\u2663 Daily challenges - There are always a new Patience card game to play everyday\r\n\u2663 Classic Solitaire Games Playable offline\r\n\u2663 Solitaire card games player statistics\r\n\u2663 Solitaire card games & classic Solitaire challenges\r\n\u2663 Unlimited solitaire classic games hints & undo which help you learn how to play Solitaire\r\n\u2663 Customizable basic Solitaire card & table design\r\n\u2663 Addictive card puzzles & solitaire classic games for seniors\r\n\u2663 Random solitaire card games & Winnable solitaire decks\r\n\u2663 Left-Handed Solitaire Mode\r\n\u2663 Solitaire games & classic Solitaire games for seniors\r\n\u2663 Winnable Solitaire Deck, fun solitaire card games & classic games puzzle\r\n\u2663The Classic Solitaire you know & love reimagined for the mobile age\r\n\r\nHow To Play Classic Solitaire Games:\r\nNever heard of the classic Solitaire card games or addictive card puzzle Patience before? In this games for seniors, the aim of the solitaire card games is to expose all the playing cards & move them to the 4 foundation piles which are built in suits from Aces to Kings in winnable Solitaire decks. Be a Solitaire King now! A Daily Solitaire card game is great to keep your mind sharp!\r\n\r\nLooking for solitaire classic games for seniors to unwind? In basic Solitaire card games (also known as Patience or Classic Solitaire) 7 columns are built downward in alternating colors. The aim of the basic Solitaire game is to clear the rows of playing cards into the foundation piles\r\n\r\nAlready know how to play the Solitaire card games? Are you a Solitaire Master? Classic Solitaire can train your brain & improve problem-solving skills! Return to the addictive card puzzle & timeless fun solitaire card games. Be the Solitaire Master & play classic games anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nOur classic Solitaire card games for seniors teach you how to play Solitaire. The fun solitaire card games is easy to learn! Play easy winnable Solitaire games or test your Patience with hard mode. Enjoy addictive card puzzles, solitaire classic games, & daily Solitaire, and be the Solitaire Master. Playing cards has never been better!\r\n\r\nThanks for playing Classic Solitaire. Have any suggestions for our solitaire card games? Let us know at solitaire-support@tripledotstudios.com\r\n\r\nThere\u2019s endless classic Solitaire & classic games to play. Play the SOLITAIRE card game and be a Solitaire King! Winnable Solitaire games & fun card games available 24/7!\r\n\r\nLike us on Facebook, share your strategy for Classic Solitaire & find the latest news:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Solitaire-398627873927679/",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u200b\u200bClassic Solitaire is the best way to play the classic card games you know &amp; love!<br><br>The most popular card game in the world, classic Solitaire, also known as Patience, is great to relax. Train your brain with solitaire classic games. With beautiful cards, fun animations, &amp; free, offline play, basic Solitaire is the best card game to pass time. Expose all playing cards, and be the Solitaire Master! With both random &amp; winnable Solitaire decks &amp; beautiful graphics, Classic Solitaire is one of the most Solitaire games in the world.<br><br>Want to test your patience with card games? Classic Solitaire is perfect! Designed for all ages, Solitaire is the perfect classic games for seniors. Choose from multiple modes and become the Solitaire King! The Classic Solitaire cards app is customizable - personalize the look &amp; feel of your Classic Solitaire &amp; classic games for seniors. Download Classic Solitaire now &amp; start playing our solitaire classic!<br><br>Do you have the perfect strategy for Classic Solitaire? Try daily challenges or play unlimited solitaire card games &amp; winnable solitaire decks! Test your patience &amp; choose between classic Solitaire or Vegas scoring, then become the Solitaire King! Try our daily Solitaire challenges &amp; customize your solitaire classic games cards, table, &amp; Solitaire games mode to play your way! These solitaire classic games will hook you on Classic Solitaire card games!<br><br>Classic Solitaire Games Features:<br>\u2663 Classic Solitaire card games for seniors<br>\u2663 Daily challenges - There are always a new Patience card game to play everyday<br>\u2663 Classic Solitaire Games Playable offline<br>\u2663 Solitaire card games player statistics<br>\u2663 Solitaire card games &amp; classic Solitaire challenges<br>\u2663 Unlimited solitaire classic games hints &amp; undo which help you learn how to play Solitaire<br>\u2663 Customizable basic Solitaire card &amp; table design<br>\u2663 Addictive card puzzles &amp; solitaire classic games for seniors<br>\u2663 Random solitaire card games &amp; Winnable solitaire decks<br>\u2663 Left-Handed Solitaire Mode<br>\u2663 Solitaire games &amp; classic Solitaire games for seniors<br>\u2663 Winnable Solitaire Deck, fun solitaire card games &amp; classic games puzzle<br>\u2663The Classic Solitaire you know &amp; love reimagined for the mobile age<br><br>How To Play Classic Solitaire Games:<br>Never heard of the classic Solitaire card games or addictive card puzzle Patience before? In this games for seniors, the aim of the solitaire card games is to expose all the playing cards &amp; move them to the 4 foundation piles which are built in suits from Aces to Kings in winnable Solitaire decks. Be a Solitaire King now! A Daily Solitaire card game is great to keep your mind sharp!<br><br>Looking for solitaire classic games for seniors to unwind? In basic Solitaire card games (also known as Patience or Classic Solitaire) 7 columns are built downward in alternating colors. The aim of the basic Solitaire game is to clear the rows of playing cards into the foundation piles<br><br>Already know how to play the Solitaire card games? Are you a Solitaire Master? Classic Solitaire can train your brain &amp; improve problem-solving skills! Return to the addictive card puzzle &amp; timeless fun solitaire card games. Be the Solitaire Master &amp; play classic games anytime, anywhere!<br><br>Our classic Solitaire card games for seniors teach you how to play Solitaire. The fun solitaire card games is easy to learn! Play easy winnable Solitaire games or test your Patience with hard mode. Enjoy addictive card puzzles, solitaire classic games, &amp; daily Solitaire, and be the Solitaire Master. Playing cards has never been better!<br><br>Thanks for playing Classic Solitaire. Have any suggestions for our solitaire card games? Let us know at solitaire-support@tripledotstudios.com<br><br>There\u2019s endless classic Solitaire &amp; classic games to play. Play the SOLITAIRE card game and be a Solitaire King! Winnable Solitaire games &amp; fun card games available 24/7!<br><br>Like us on Facebook, share your strategy for Classic Solitaire &amp; find the latest news:<br>https://www.facebook.com/Solitaire-398627873927679/",
